@@ -700,3 +700,8 @@
 texture-array handle materialization alongside ordinary depth sampling. A
 `sample_compare`-only argument array keeps its image descriptor and comparison
 sampler; the depth handle must not fall through to null-result protection.
+
+Sampled depth cube texel reads share the cube texel-center path with color
+reads. The depth AIR control operand precedes the integer coordinate; face,
+optional array slice and named mip remain separate until the shared lowering.
+The result extracts the sampled depth component and retains AIR's scalar ABI.
